<div class="frame" style="width: 380px; height: 1180px;">
  <div class="apphead" style="padding: 0 16px; gap: 10px;">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.2px;">Advantage</span>
    <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
    <span style="display: block; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span>
  </div>
  <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; min-height: 0; background: var(--surface-muted);">
    <div class="rail" style="flex: 0 0 300px; background: var(--surface-card); gap: 0; padding: 18px 20px;">
      <!-- Identity. The verified check follows the pair it verifies — the
           result — rather than interrupting the two names. -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Match</span>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; min-width: 0;">
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap;">M. Ellison</span>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-500);">vs</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600); min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">R. Duval</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
          <span class="score">6&ndash;4 3&ndash;6 7&ndash;5</span>
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--viz-good)" stroke-width="2" aria-label="Verified result"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height: 1px; background: var(--border-hairline); margin: 16px 0;"></div>

      <!-- Facts. One 16px icon column, one family, one stroke weight, 13px on a
           20px optical box so every row sits on the same rhythm. The two the
           analysis produced are separated from the two the player entered. -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px;">
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-700);">Mar 14, 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="1"></rect><path d="M3 12h18M8 3v18M16 3v18M12 8v8"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro" style="color: var(--ink-700);">Hard</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular mono" style="color: var(--ink-700);">02:14:38</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13.5l4-5 4 4 3-4.5 3 3.5 4-6"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-700);">247 points &middot; 31 games</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- A long opponent name truncates rather than wrapping the pair onto two
           lines and pushing the score down. Same block, worst case. -->
      <div style="margin-top: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-sm">Long name</span>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; min-width: 0;">
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap;">M. Ellison</span>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-500);">vs</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600); min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">R. Vandenberghe-Or&hellip;</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-subtle); padding: 11px 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-sm">Match data</span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 100%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 86%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 54%;"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cap">
    <h3>Rail 1 &mdash; Classic, cleaned up</h3>
    <p>Same rail, tidied. The verified check now follows the score it verifies instead of splitting the two names; the icons are redrawn as one family at one stroke weight, with the court reading as a court and the rally mark replacing the crossed swords; a hairline separates identity from facts; and a long opponent name truncates rather than wrapping the pair and shoving the score down.</p>
    <p class="trade">Mono stays on the duration only &mdash; the type scale reserves it for machine values and rules it out for stats.</p>
  </div>
</div>
